@base = http://localhost:5080/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List orders
GET {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create order (admin/rajat only)
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Apex Logistics",
  "piType": "Sale",
  "quantity": 100,
  "stateCode": "DL"
}

### Unassign a vehicle (preserves history, logs event)
POST {{base}}/vehicles/VIN123/unassign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "wrong lot" }

### Vehicle assignment history
GET {{base}}/vehicles/VIN123/assignment-events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insurance history for a vehicle
GET {{base}}/vehicles/VIN123/insurance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Policies expiring in 30 days
GET {{base}}/insurance/expiring?withinDays=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
